  "id": "graphesthesia",
  "term": "graphesthesia",
  "definition": "Graphesthesia is the ability to recognize or interpret a symbol traced on the skin through touch alone. In this context, it was assessed by presenting ambiguous tactile letters on the stomach and inferring the perspective the person used to identify them.",
